[al:新概念英语（一）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Tommy's Breakfast]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.79]Lesson 117 | 第117课
[00:04.50]Tommy's breakfast | 汤米的早餐
[00:07.35]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:13.44]What does she mean by 'change' in the last sentence? | 她最后一句中的'change'是什么意思?
[00:21.27]When my husband was going into the dining room this morning, | 今天早上,我丈夫走进餐厅的时候,
[00:27.20]he dropped some coins on the floor. | 他把一些硬币掉在了地板上。
[00:31.54]There were coins everywhere. | 到处都是硬币。
[00:34.96]We looked for them, but we could not find them all. | 我们找了找,但没找到所有的硬币。
[00:41.10]While we were having breakfast, | 我们正在吃早饭的时候,
[00:44.42]our little boy, Tommy, found two small coins on the floor. | 我们的小男孩汤米在地板上找到了两枚小硬币。
[00:52.56]He put them both into his mouth. | 他把两枚都放进了嘴里。
[00:57.16]We both tried to get the coins, but it was too late. | 我们俩都试图把硬币拿出来,但已经太晚了。
[01:03.56]Tommy had already swallowed them! | 汤米已经把它们吞了下去!
[01:09.90]Late that morning, when I was doing the housework, | 那天上午晚些时候,当我在做家务时,
[01:15.43]My husband phoned me from the office. | 我丈夫从办公室打来电话。
[01:20.36]'How's Tommy?' he asked. | 他问:'汤米怎么样?'
[01:24.00]'I don't know,' I answered, | 我回答说:'我不知道。'
[01:27.56]'Tommy's been to the toilet three times this morning, but I haven't had any change yet!' | '今天早上汤米已经上了三次厕所,但我还没拿到零钱!'